  falls into the hands of Alec Trevelyan\, AKA Agent 006 (Sean Bean)\, a fo
 rmer ally-turned-enemy\, only James Bond (Pierce Brosnan) can save the wor
 ld from an awesome space weapon that -- in one short pulse -- could destro
 y the earth!  It's a formal night at Uptown! Sport your tailored suits an
 d elegant dresses for a sophisticated evening of espionage. Tuxedo t-shir
 ts are also acceptable.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-and-events/cold-
 war-summer/goldeneye\n\nEstimated start: 19:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
